  "rating": {
    "inherent": "high",
    "residual": "high",
    "forecast": "high",
    "rationale": "Present risk is a property finding: the agent performs consequential production actions using the engineer's own delegated identity, while the only prompt-to-action provenance is deletable chat history. Under rubric section 5a, the affected capabilities include irreversible production migration and production execution, so the inherent tier is high and remains high because no declared control restores attributable, tamper-evident agent records. No considered forecast trigger lowers or raises the tier because the design already lacks the missing provenance control."
  },
